  "headline": "FDA's records show no public shortage signal for the Baxter Healthcare Corporation product (NDC 43066-014-01) used at our facilities",
  "headline_cites": ["E1", "E2", "E4", "E5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The FDA shortage list shows discontinuations by Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC (NDC 63323-750-10) posted 2026-02-25 and Jiangsu Hengrui Pharmaceuticals Co., Ltd. (NDC 25021-233-10) posted 2026-06-29, but no entry for the Baxter product we stock.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both Corvale General and Corvale Lakeside carry oxaliplatin under NDC 43066-014-01 labeled by Baxter Healthcare Corporation.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies FAREVA Unterach GmbH for Sandoz Inc. as the manufacturing site for this NDC.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 57 units with 20 days on hand at current use, while Corvale Lakeside holds 8 units with 9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 6 units from Corvale General to Corvale Lakeside would leave the sender with about 18 days of supply and bring the receiver to roughly 15 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    }
  ]
